# Cheatsheet: both looks (runner does both).
ipc panels open cheatsheet TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot open
note Cheatsheet open; same layout, groups and look as QML.
ipc panels close
wait 1
rec open 1 ipc panels open cheatsheet TESSERA-TEST
note Open curve: Material settles in about 0.3 s, Glass about 0.4 s; compare with QML within 1 frame.
wait 1
rec close 0.4 key -k Escape
note Escape closes in 192 ms, same as QML.
wait 1
ipc panels open cheatsheet TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness. "Periodic table" segment position is read from the shot (unknown here).
# MANUAL: click "Periodic table" -> Material: the segment's inner corners round with a small overshoot in about 0.22 s; Glass: the pill slides in 220 ms
# MANUAL: glide over an element -> tint 45 % + outline; Material rounds in about 0.22 s
# MANUAL: Shortcuts page: binds in three columns (page switch needs the segment position)
shot shortcuts
note Shortcuts page if reachable: binds in three columns, same groups and keys as QML; otherwise the default page matches QML.
ipc panels close
